# WARP-8: a held step's knob 4 on the kit nudges the picked drum alone where the step has other drums too (a lane of
# its own); alone on the step it is the step's nudge. OCT- and OCT+ with the step held move the whole step
wait 300
listen
expect trk 1
tapkey b0
tapkey w4
expect lanes 0
# the kick alone on step 5: the step's nudge, no lane
key w4 down
wait 100
turn K4 3
wait 500
said NUDGE
key w4 up
wait 40
expect lanes 0
# a snare beside it: knob 4 is the snare's own
tapkey b1
tapkey w4
key w4 down
wait 100
turn K4 -5
wait 500
said NUDGE
shot nudge.png
key w4 up
wait 40
expect lanes 1
# back to none: the lane goes
key w4 down
wait 100
turn K4 5
wait 40
key w4 up
wait 40
expect lanes 0
# and the snare taken off a step leaves no nudge of its own behind
key w4 down
wait 100
turn K4 2
wait 40
key w4 up
expect lanes 1
tapkey w4
wait 40
expect lanes 0
